{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Encave",
    "steam_appid": 3246990,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/b063a4a34752ca27d77e27906861496e.avif?t=1747219066\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t\t</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENCAVE </strong>is a first-person survival builder set in a post-disaster world. Trapped in an underground bunker, you must explore, scavenge hidden resources, and trade with other survivors to expand your base and ensure your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD</strong>, <strong>CRAFT</strong>, and <strong>GROW</strong> your underground colony\u2014plant food, attract settlers, and develop a self-sustaining community. To protect what you\u2019ve built, <strong>DESIGN A DEADLY KILLROOM</strong> within your base, fortified with traps, turrets, and barricades to fend off relentless waves of enemies descending from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEND</strong>, <strong>EXPAND</strong>, and <strong>THRIVE</strong> as you transform your bunker into a fortified haven in a world where danger never stops coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge and recycle</strong> for valuable resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/628f07921cdbfde77ddfac1571c07ea2.poster.avif?t=1747219066\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/628f07921cdbfde77ddfac1571c07ea2.webm?t=1747219066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/628f07921cdbfde77ddfac1571c07ea2.mp4?t=1747219066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine</strong> resources and carve out your underground haven</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/20f501203f061b18988a2d4a8f8e06de.poster.avif?t=1747219066\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/20f501203f061b18988a2d4a8f8e06de.webm?t=1747219066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/20f501203f061b18988a2d4a8f8e06de.mp4?t=1747219066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and upgrade a deadly killroom</strong> to trap, burn, and shred incoming enemies before they breach your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/58a7d557d252b52ad754e49566cddccc.poster.avif?t=1747219066\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/58a7d557d252b52ad754e49566cddccc.webm?t=1747219066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/58a7d557d252b52ad754e49566cddccc.mp4?t=1747219066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultivate life below ground</strong>\u2014grow and cook your own survival food</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/64a134fcd80fc0a7e1ff36e11c0b4735.poster.avif?t=1747219066\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/64a134fcd80fc0a7e1ff36e11c0b4735.webm?t=1747219066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/64a134fcd80fc0a7e1ff36e11c0b4735.mp4?t=1747219066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/cf55ded926e4717e025c7817659d652b.poster.avif?t=1747219066\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/cf55ded926e4717e025c7817659d652b.webm?t=1747219066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/cf55ded926e4717e025c7817659d652b.mp4?t=1747219066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/04a2d0be3a435b69b3b3fbeb307ebbc4.avif?t=1747219066\" data-has-big width=800 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft &amp; Build Equipment</strong> \u2013 We\u2019re refining the crafting system to let you gather resources and create essential tools, weapons, and survival gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with Other Survivors</strong> \u2013 Work is underway to deepen interactions, allowing you to recruit allies, build relationships, and uncover hidden stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Bunker</strong> \u2013 We\u2019re adding new construction options so you can build and upgrade rooms to improve your shelter\u2019s functionality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assign Jobs &amp; Manage Residents</strong> \u2013 A detailed job system is being fine-tuned, enabling you to assign roles and optimize your community\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade &amp; Unlock Blueprints</strong> \u2013 We're improving the trading system, letting you exchange goods for blueprints to unlock advanced tools, weapons, machines, plants, and furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain &amp; Repair</strong> \u2013 We\u2019re enhancing repair mechanics to keep your equipment and utilities functional, ensuring your bunker remains habitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>These features are actively being developed, and we can\u2019t wait to share more updates soon!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/b063a4a34752ca27d77e27906861496e.avif?t=1747219066\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\t\t</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENCAVE </strong>is a first-person survival builder set in a post-disaster world. Trapped in an underground bunker, you must explore, scavenge hidden resources, and trade with other survivors to expand your base and ensure your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD</strong>, <strong>CRAFT</strong>, and <strong>GROW</strong> your underground colony\u2014plant food, attract settlers, and develop a self-sustaining community. To protect what you\u2019ve built, <strong>DESIGN A DEADLY KILLROOM</strong> within your base, fortified with traps, turrets, and barricades to fend off relentless waves of enemies descending from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEND</strong>, <strong>EXPAND</strong>, and <strong>THRIVE</strong> as you transform your bunker into a fortified haven in a world where danger never stops coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge and recycle</strong> for valuable resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/628f07921cdbfde77ddfac1571c07ea2.poster.avif?t=1747219066\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/628f07921cdbfde77ddfac1571c07ea2.webm?t=1747219066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a