>Interact with Other Survivors</strong> \u2013 Work is underway to deepen interactions, allowing you to recruit allies, build relationships, and uncover hidden stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Bunker</strong> \u2013 We\u2019re adding new construction options so you can build and upgrade rooms to improve your shelter\u2019s functionality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assign Jobs &amp; Manage Residents</strong> \u2013 A detailed job system is being fine-tuned, enabling you to assign roles and optimize your community\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade &amp; Unlock Blueprints</strong> \u2013 We're improving the trading system, letting you exchange goods for blueprints to unlock advanced tools, weapons, machines, plants, and furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain &amp; Repair</strong> \u2013 We\u2019re enhancing repair mechanics to keep your equipment and utilities functional, ensuring your bunker remains habitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>These features are actively being developed, and we can\u2019t wait to share more updates soon!</strong></p>",
